WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.487
The takeaway is simple.

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:07.280
Adapting a foundation model to a hard new domain
works best when you also give it the

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.733
right data and let it prompt itself.

00:00:09.813 --> 00:00:16.275
By building USIS10K and teaching SAM to see
underwater while generating its own salient prompts,

00:00:16.355 --> 00:00:18.796
USIS-SAM sets a new state of the art.

00:00:18.876 --> 00:00:24.520
With dataset and code released, it lays a
foundation for underwater vision research.
